/Title (ABOUT THE CONFERENCE The International Conference on Next-Gen Technologies in Communication and Computing \(NexTCom-2026\) aims to serve as a premier platform for researchers, industry leaders, and academicians to exchange cutting-edge knowledge, innovative ideas, and advancements in emerging technologies. The conference will raise awareness about emerging trends, tools, and technologies in fields such as communication technologies, 5G/6G networks, artificial intelligence and machine learning \(AIML\), quantum computing, internet of things \(IoT\), block chain, cloud computing, and related areas and fostering discussions on their transformative impact across industries. A key focus is to strengthen industry-academia collaboration, accelerating the real-world adoption of innovative solutions.)
